        summary: 'Expired stock segregated, stamped "NOT FOR SALE / NOT FOR USE / NOT FOR MANUFACTURE", kept in a separate place declared "DATE-EXPIRED INSECTICIDES", recorded and disposed of in an environmentally friendly manner.',
        legalText: '10-A(a): date-expired stock shall be segregated; stamped "NOT FOR SALE", "NOT FOR USE" and "NOT FOR MANUFACTURE"; and kept in a separate place carrying the declaration "DATE-EXPIRED INSECTICIDES". 10-A(b): expired insecticides shall be disposed of in an environmentally friendly manner. Records are maintained in Appendix A — Register of Date Expired Pesticides.',
