        summary: 'Licensee may sell insecticides through an e-commerce entity for doorstep supply to farmers; operator must verify licence validity; Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020 apply.',
        legalText: 'A licensee may undertake sale of insecticides through an e-commerce entity for supply of insecticides to the doorstep of farmers. Before engaging a licensee, the e-commerce operator shall verify the validity of the licence issued by the concerned State Licensing Officer. The e-commerce operator and licensee shall comply with the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020, including subsequent amendments (G.S.R. No. 462(E), dated 23 July 2020).',
