        summary: 'Transfer on application, fee, inquiry and written permission of the Licensing Officer.',
        legalText: 'A licence may be transferred to another person subject to application, prescribed fee (\u20b9100), inquiry by the Licensing Officer, satisfaction of the Licensing Officer and written permission. If transfer permission is refused, the prescribed fee treatment applies.',
