        summary: 'No altering, obliterating or defacing inscriptions/marks on containers, labels or wrappers unless authorised.',
        legalText: 'No person shall alter, obliterate or deface prescribed inscriptions/marks on insecticide containers, labels or wrappers unless the alteration is authorised according to the Rules/Registration Committee.',
