        legalText: 'On receiving a sample, the Analyst checks the package (condition, seal, identification) and the sample (identity, marking, quantity, relevant particulars). Analysis is conducted according to prescribed specifications, approved methods and Registration Committee-approved methods. After analysis the Analyst prepares the prescribed report in Form IV (Rule 24(3) — Part A coding, Part B analysis).',
