        legalText: 'Where an Inspector is specially authorised to inspect manufacturing premises: 28(1) inspect such premises not less than twice a year (half-yearly); 28(2) send a detailed report to the Licensing Authority of the conditions observed and violations; 28(3) draw samples and send them for test or analysis; 28(4) report all occurrences of poisoning to Government.',
        plainEnglish: 'Manufacturing-unit duty — 2 inspections a year with sampling, reporting and mandatory poisoning escalation.',
