        legalText: 'When an Inspector takes an insecticide sample for test/analysis, prescribed intimation is given in Form V(C), containing insecticide name, common name, active ingredient, formulation, batch number, manufacturer, date of manufacture, registration number, marketed by, manufacturing licence number, date of expiry, quantity sampled, stock available and other relevant details.',
