        legalText: 'Insecticides shall be stored in a separate room away from other articles and not in a manner that permits contact with foodstuffs, animal feed or other consumable materials. The room should be well-built, dry, well-lit, well-ventilated and of sufficient dimensions. Where required, insecticides should be kept separately from other articles.',
